WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
What are you talking about?

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,200
What do you mean by wrapping him up?

3
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,160
Am I this kind of person? Besides, you don’t know him?

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,120
He is definitely not this kind of person. You have to tell him about this.

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,520
He might still be angry

6
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:11,480
There are still men like this in this day and age. You don’t know him. Let’s go and take a look. Let’s go back to the office.

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,800
Don't disturb others' rest

8
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,400
I think this thing is very useful

9
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,440
I'm preparing to launch one over there

10
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,840
Our country’s local luxury goods series are quite good.

11
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:20,600
Otherwise, if you ask him if he still has this thing, of course it is true if he says it is true.

12
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,000
I have been in the cosmetics business for so many years

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,920
Don’t you know me yet?

14
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,920
I used to be a big foreign brand

15
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,920
Now I don’t even want to do big foreign brands, I just do our domestic series.

16
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,440
And based on what I know about it

17
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,720
Our domestic brands will have an explosion

18
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,600
If you ask him if he is willing

19
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,840
Just bring me some samples

20
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,200
I will sell it in our store

21
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,840
If it sells well, we can officially launch it.

22
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,600
If it doesn't sell well, forget it.

23
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,600
When the show was over, I specifically asked him if he was willing. If he wasn't willing, forget it.

24
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,100
If you tell him, he will definitely be willing.

25
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,620
wait a moment

26
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,460
I have a business that I want to discuss with you. Is it profitable? Is this the case?

27
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,940
That box of Japanese incense you just gave me

28
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:57,340
I have a friend who specializes in cosmetics, if possible

29
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,420
I will buy goods from you for a long time in the future.

30
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,500
He has a chance to sell well

31
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:00,460
And become famous
